, GEO, digital marketing, website development, branding, reputation management, and business technology solutions for clients in the United States and worldwide.\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog?search={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}}</script><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-border/70 bg-white/88 backdrop-blur\"><div class=\"container-tight flex h-[72px] items-center justify-between gap-4\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" aria-label=\"MIQ LLC home\" href=\"/\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-9 w-9\"><rect width=\"64\" height=\"64\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#0B1B33\"></rect><path d=\"M18 44V20h6.2l7.8 12.2L39.8 20H46v24h-5.7V29.4l-8.3 12.8-8.3-12.8V44H18Z\" fill=\"white\"></path><path d=\"M46 44c0-4.2 3.2-7 7.6-7 .1 0 .3 0 .4 0v5c-.2 0-.4-.1-.7-.1-1.6 0-2.7.8-2.7 2.5V44H46Z\" fill=\"#C8A24A\"></path><circle cx=\"48.5\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#3B82F6\"></circle></svg><span class=\"font-display text-base font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-lg\">MIQ LLC</span></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-1 md:flex\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal transition hover:bg-surface hover:text-navy\" href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal transition hover:bg-surface hover:text-navy\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal transition hover:bg-surface hover:text-navy\" href=\"/services\">Services</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal transition hover:bg-surface hover:text-navy\" href=\"/portfolio\">Portfolio</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal transition hover:bg-surface hover:text-navy\" href=\"/blog\">Insights</a><a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal transition hover:bg-surface hover:text-navy\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"hidden md:block\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-navy px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-navy-2\" href=\"/contact\">Get a Free Consultation</a></div><button class=\"inline-flex rounded-lg p-2 text-navy md:hidden\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><!--&--><!--&--><!--&--><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/services/wikipedia-services#webpage\",\"name\":\"Worldwide Wikipedia Services & Consulting\",\"description\":\"Worldwide Wikipedia consulting, Wikipedia page creation guidance, Wikipedia editing services, notability assessment, citation research, and policy-aware page maintenance for companies, brands, executives, and organizations in the United States and internationally.\",\"url\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/services/wikipedia-services\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#website\"},\"about\":{\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Worldwide Wikipedia Services & Consulting\",\"description\":\"Worldwide Wikipedia consulting, Wikipedia page creation guidance, Wikipedia editing services, notability assessment, citation research, and policy-aware page maintenance for companies, brands, executives, and organizations in the United States and internationally.\",\"serviceType\":\"Wikipedia\",\"url\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/services/wikipedia-services\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":[\"United States\",\"Worldwide\"],\"audience\":{\"@type\":\"BusinessAudience\",\"audienceType\":\"Companies, executives, organizations, and entrepreneurs worldwide\"},\"availableChannel\":{\"@type\":\"ServiceChannel\",\"serviceUrl\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/contact\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\",\"en\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Services\",\"item\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/services\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Worldwide Wikipedia Services & Consulting\",\"item\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/services/wikipedia-services\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is a Wikipedia page creation service?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A Wikipedia page creation service helps eligible people, companies, and organizations assess Wikipedia notability, gather independent reliable sources, and prepare neutral, policy-aware draft or editing guidance. A responsible service does not control Wikipedia; independent volunteer editors review and decide on articles.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I create a Wikipedia page for my company or myself?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"To create a Wikipedia page, first confirm the subject meets Wikipedia notability guidelines through significant coverage in reliable, independent secondary sources. Then gather verifiable citations, draft a neutral article, follow conflict-of-interest and paid-contribution disclosure rules, and submit through the appropriate process (such as Articles for Creation). MIQ LLC can start with a notability and source assessment and provide policy-aware guidance.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can anyone get a Wikipedia page?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. A subject generally needs significant coverage in reliable, independent secondary sources to meet Wikipedia notability guidelines. Press releases, paid placements, company websites, social profiles, and routine announcements usually do not establish notability on their own.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much does Wikipedia page creation cost?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Wikipedia page creation and consulting costs vary based on the subject, available independent sources, research required, drafting complexity, and whether ongoing maintenance is needed. MIQ LLC provides a scope-based quote after reviewing your goals and existing reliable coverage; we do not charge for guaranteed approval because publication cannot be guaranteed.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does it take to create or publish a Wikipedia page?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Timelines depend on notability, source availability, research, drafting, and independent Wikipedia review. Research and draft preparation can take weeks, while review and publication times vary because volunteer editors control the process. MIQ LLC focuses on thorough, policy-compliant preparation rather than promising a fixed publication date.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you guarantee Wikipedia publication or page retention?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. MIQ LLC does not guarantee Wikipedia publication, approval, ranking, or retention. Wikipedia articles are reviewed and maintained by independent editors under community policies. Our role is ethical, research-driven consulting and policy-aware guidance.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What sources does Wikipedia consider reliable for notability?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Wikipedia generally looks for significant coverage in reliable, independent secondary sources such as reputable newspapers, magazines, books, academic publications, and editorially controlled media. The sources should be independent of the subject. Self-published content, press releases, and sponsored content are usually weak evidence of notability.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you follow Wikipedia paid-contribution and conflict-of-interest disclosure rules?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Our approach emphasizes transparency and alignment with Wikipedia paid-contribution disclosure and conflict-of-interest expectations. When compensated contributions are involved, disclosure and policy-compliant processes should be followed.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What Wikipedia services do you provide?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"MIQ LLC provides Wikipedia consulting, notability assessment, independent source and citation research, neutral article writing guidance, Wikipedia editing support, Articles for Creation (AfC) process guidance, conflict-of-interest guidance, and Wikipedia page maintenance or monitoring recommendations.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you provide worldwide Wikipedia consulting for international clients?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. MIQ LLC provides worldwide Wikipedia consulting for clients in the United States and internationally, supporting notability assessment, source research, neutral drafting guidance, editing support, and policy-aware recommendations through a digital-first process.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to get started with Worldwide Wikipedia Services & Consulting\",\"description\":\"Worldwide Wikipedia consulting, Wikipedia page creation guidance, Wikipedia editing services, notability assessment, citation research, and policy-aware page maintenance for companies, brands, executives, and organizations in the United States and internationally.\",\"totalTime\":\"P14D\",\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Discovery & Goals\",\"text\":\"We review your background, objectives, existing public profile, and whether you need Wikipedia page creation, editing, notability research, or policy consultation.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Notability & Source Assessment\",\"text\":\"We evaluate independent reliable sources against Wikipedia notability standards, identify citation gaps, and determine whether the subject may be ready for a Wikipedia article or needs stronger third-party coverage.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Drafting, Citations & Policy Guidance\",\"text\":\"We organize verifiable sources and provide neutral, encyclopedic drafting or Wikipedia editing guidance with attention to reliable sourcing, neutrality, and conflict-of-interest considerations.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Review, Disclosure & Maintenance\",\"text\":\"We recommend compliant next steps, including paid-contribution disclosure guidance, Articles for Creation considerations where relevant, and ongoing Wikipedia page maintenance or monitoring recommendations.\"}]}</script><section class=\"hero-grid text-white\"><div class=\"grid-lines\"><div class=\"container-tight py-20 md:py-28\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"mb-4 text-sm text-white/65\"><ol class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">/</li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white\" href=\"/services\">Services</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\">/</li><li class=\"text-white/85\">Worldwide Wikipedia Services &amp; Consulting</li></ol></nav><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\"><span class=\"text-sky-300\">Service</span></p><h1 class=\"font-display max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-6xl\">Wikipedia Page Creation Service, Consulting &amp; Editing (Worldwide)</h1><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/78\">MIQ LLC provides a worldwide Wikipedia page creation service and Wikipedia consulting for companies, brands, executives, and public figures. We help with Wikipedia notability assessment, independent reliable source research, neutral Wikipedia article writing guidance, Wikipedia editing support, conflict-of-interest disclosure guidance, and responsible Wikipedia page maintenance for clients in the United States and internationally.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-navy\" href=\"/contact\">Request a Free Consultation</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-white/20 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/services\">All Services</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad border-b border-border bg-surface py-10 md:py-12\"><div class=\"container-tight \"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-electric/15 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm md:p-8\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric\">Quick answer</p><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-4xl text-base leading-7 text-charcoal\">A Wikipedia page creation service helps eligible subjects determine notability, gather independent reliable sources, and prepare neutral, policy-aware Wikipedia drafts or edits. To create a Wikipedia page, the subject usually needs significant coverage in independent secondary sources, a neutral point of view, verifiable citations, and compliance with Wikipedia conflict-of-interest and paid-contribution disclosure rules. No consultant can guarantee Wikipedia publication or retention because final decisions are made by independent Wikipedia editors.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad \"><div class=\"container-tight grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr]\"><div><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\">Overview</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl \">Worldwide Wikipedia Services &amp; Consulting</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-muted\">Worldwide Wikipedia consulting, Wikipedia page creation guidance, Wikipedia editing services, notability assessment, citation research, and policy-aware page maintenance for companies, brands, executives, and organizations in the United States and internationally.</p><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4 text-sm text-charcoal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg> <span>Wikipedia Page Creation Consultancy</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4 text-sm text-charcoal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg> <span>Wikipedia Article Writing &amp; Neutral Drafting Guidance</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4 text-sm text-charcoal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg> <span>Wikipedia Editing &amp; Content Updates</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4 text-sm text-charcoal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg> <span>Wikipedia Notability Assessment &amp; Research</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4 text-sm text-charcoal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg> <span>Wikipedia Citation &amp; Reliable Source Research</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4 text-sm text-charcoal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg> <span>Articles for Creation (AfC) Process Guidance</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4 text-sm text-charcoal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg> <span>Wikipedia Page Maintenance &amp; Monitoring</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4 text-sm text-charcoal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg> <span>Wikipedia Policy &amp; Conflict-of-Interest Consultation</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-4 text-sm text-charcoal\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg> <span>Company, Brand &amp; Biography Wikipedia Page Guidance</span></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-gold/30 bg-gold/10 p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-charcoal\"><strong>Important:</strong> Wikipedia consulting, Wikipedia page creation guidance, and Wikipedia editing services must follow independent editorial policies, notability guidelines, reliable sourcing requirements, and paid-contribution disclosure rules. MIQ Enterprises LLC does not guarantee publication or retention.</div></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-border bg-white p-6 shadow-sm\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-xl font-semibold text-navy\">Start a Service Inquiry</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-muted\">Tell us about your goals and we’ll respond with next steps.</p><div class=\"mt-5\"><form class=\"grid gap-4\"><input type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\" name=\"companyWebsite\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"service\" value=\"Worldwide Wikipedia Services &amp; Consulting\"/><div class=\"grid gap-4 \"><label class=\"grid gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal\">Full name<input required=\"\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted/80\" placeholder=\"Your name\" name=\"name\"/></label><label class=\"grid gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal\">Email<input required=\"\" type=\"email\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted/80\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" name=\"email\"/></label></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 \"><label class=\"grid gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal\">Phone / WhatsApp (optional)<input class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted/80\" placeholder=\"+1...\" name=\"phone\"/></label><label class=\"grid gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal\">Inquiry type<select name=\"inquiryType\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted/80\"><option>Free Consultation</option><option selected=\"\">Service Inquiry</option><option>Request a Quote</option><option>General Question</option></select></label></div><label class=\"grid gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-charcoal\">Message<textarea required=\"\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm text-foreground placeholder:text-muted/80\" placeholder=\"Tell us about your goals, timeline, and the services you need.\"></textarea></label><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-navy-2 disabled:opacity-60\">Submit Inquiry</button><p class=\"text-xs text-muted\">By submitting, you agree to be contacted regarding your inquiry. We use form validation and spam protection; please provide accurate information.</p></form></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad bg-surface\"><div class=\"container-tight grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2\"><div><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\">Benefits</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl \">Why clients choose this service</h2><ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-1 shrink-0 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Clear understanding of Wikipedia notability guidelines before investing in page creation</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-1 shrink-0 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Research-driven approach focused on verifiability and neutral point of view (NPOV)</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-1 shrink-0 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Responsible Wikipedia consulting aligned with community and editorial policies</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-1 shrink-0 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Transparent communication about eligibility, sourcing gaps, and risks</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-1 shrink-0 text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Support for companies, executives, organizations, and public figures seeking credible guidance</li></ul></div><div><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\">Deliverables</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl \">What this engagement can include</h2><ul class=\"mt-6 space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-1 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Wikipedia notability assessment based on independent, reliable secondary sources</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-1 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Source research, citation recommendations, and coverage gap analysis</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-1 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Neutral, encyclopedic, policy-aware draft or edit guidance</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-1 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Paid-contribution and conflict-of-interest disclosure guidance</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-1 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Articles for Creation (AfC) and editorial process recommendations where applicable</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-1 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Wikipedia page maintenance, monitoring, and update recommendations</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-muted\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 mt-1 shrink-0 text-electric\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg>Clear next-step plan, including when more independent coverage may be needed</li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad \"><div class=\"container-tight \"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\">Process</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl \">Our working process</h2><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border p-5\"><div class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-gold\">0<!-- -->1</div><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-semibold text-navy\">Discovery &amp; Goals</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">We review your background, objectives, existing public profile, and whether you need Wikipedia page creation, editing, notability research, or policy consultation.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border p-5\"><div class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-gold\">0<!-- -->2</div><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-semibold text-navy\">Notability &amp; Source Assessment</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">We evaluate independent reliable sources against Wikipedia notability standards, identify citation gaps, and determine whether the subject may be ready for a Wikipedia article or needs stronger third-party coverage.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border p-5\"><div class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-gold\">0<!-- -->3</div><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-semibold text-navy\">Drafting, Citations &amp; Policy Guidance</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">We organize verifiable sources and provide neutral, encyclopedic drafting or Wikipedia editing guidance with attention to reliable sourcing, neutrality, and conflict-of-interest considerations.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border p-5\"><div class=\"font-display text-sm font-semibold text-gold\">0<!-- -->4</div><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-semibold text-navy\">Review, Disclosure &amp; Maintenance</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">We recommend compliant next steps, including paid-contribution disclosure guidance, Articles for Creation considerations where relevant, and ongoing Wikipedia page maintenance or monitoring recommendations.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad bg-surface\"><div class=\"container-tight grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr]\"><div><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\">FAQ</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl \">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-muted\">Clear answers to common questions about <!-- -->worldwide wikipedia services &amp; consulting<!-- -->.</p></div><div class=\"divide-y divide-border rounded-2xl border border-border bg-white\"><details class=\"group\" open=\"\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">What is a Wikipedia page creation service?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-muted transition group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">A Wikipedia page creation service helps eligible people, companies, and organizations assess Wikipedia notability, gather independent reliable sources, and prepare neutral, policy-aware draft or editing guidance. A responsible service does not control Wikipedia; independent volunteer editors review and decide on articles.</div></details><details class=\"group\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">How do I create a Wikipedia page for my company or myself?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-muted transition group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">To create a Wikipedia page, first confirm the subject meets Wikipedia notability guidelines through significant coverage in reliable, independent secondary sources. Then gather verifiable citations, draft a neutral article, follow conflict-of-interest and paid-contribution disclosure rules, and submit through the appropriate process (such as Articles for Creation). MIQ LLC can start with a notability and source assessment and provide policy-aware guidance.</div></details><details class=\"group\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">Can anyone get a Wikipedia page?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-muted transition group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">No. A subject generally needs significant coverage in reliable, independent secondary sources to meet Wikipedia notability guidelines. Press releases, paid placements, company websites, social profiles, and routine announcements usually do not establish notability on their own.</div></details><details class=\"group\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">How much does Wikipedia page creation cost?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-muted transition group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Wikipedia page creation and consulting costs vary based on the subject, available independent sources, research required, drafting complexity, and whether ongoing maintenance is needed. MIQ LLC provides a scope-based quote after reviewing your goals and existing reliable coverage; we do not charge for guaranteed approval because publication cannot be guaranteed.</div></details><details class=\"group\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">How long does it take to create or publish a Wikipedia page?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-muted transition group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Timelines depend on notability, source availability, research, drafting, and independent Wikipedia review. Research and draft preparation can take weeks, while review and publication times vary because volunteer editors control the process. MIQ LLC focuses on thorough, policy-compliant preparation rather than promising a fixed publication date.</div></details><details class=\"group\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">Do you guarantee Wikipedia publication or page retention?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-muted transition group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">No. MIQ LLC does not guarantee Wikipedia publication, approval, ranking, or retention. Wikipedia articles are reviewed and maintained by independent editors under community policies. Our role is ethical, research-driven consulting and policy-aware guidance.</div></details><details class=\"group\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">What sources does Wikipedia consider reliable for notability?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-muted transition group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Wikipedia generally looks for significant coverage in reliable, independent secondary sources such as reputable newspapers, magazines, books, academic publications, and editorially controlled media. The sources should be independent of the subject. Self-published content, press releases, and sponsored content are usually weak evidence of notability.</div></details><details class=\"group\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">Do you follow Wikipedia paid-contribution and conflict-of-interest disclosure rules?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-muted transition group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Yes. Our approach emphasizes transparency and alignment with Wikipedia paid-contribution disclosure and conflict-of-interest expectations. When compensated contributions are involved, disclosure and policy-compliant processes should be followed.</div></details><details class=\"group\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">What Wikipedia services do you provide?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-muted transition group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">MIQ LLC provides Wikipedia consulting, notability assessment, independent source and citation research, neutral article writing guidance, Wikipedia editing support, Articles for Creation (AfC) process guidance, conflict-of-interest guidance, and Wikipedia page maintenance or monitoring recommendations.</div></details><details class=\"group\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 text-left [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span class=\"font-medium text-navy\">Do you provide worldwide Wikipedia consulting for international clients?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down shrink-0 text-muted transition group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"px-5 pb-5 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Yes. MIQ LLC provides worldwide Wikipedia consulting for clients in the United States and internationally, supporting notability assessment, source research, neutral drafting guidance, editing support, and policy-aware recommendations through a digital-first process.</div></details></div></div></section><section class=\"section-pad \"><div class=\"container-tight \"><p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\">Related</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl \">Related services</h2><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition hover:border-electric/40 hover:shadow-sm\" href=\"/services/seo-digital-marketing\"><h3 class=\"font-display font-semibold text-navy\">SEO &amp; Digital Marketing</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Data-informed SEO, AEO, GEO, and digital marketing strategies designed to improve visibility in traditional search, answer engines, and generative AI experiences.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-electric\">Explore <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition hover:border-electric/40 hover:shadow-sm\" href=\"/services/website-development\"><h3 class=\"font-display font-semibold text-navy\">Website Development</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Modern, responsive, and performance-focused websites designed to communicate trust and convert visitors into inquiries.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-electric\">Explore <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-border p-5 transition hover:border-electric/40 hover:shadow-sm\" href=\"/services/online-reputation-management\"><h3 class=\"font-display font-semibold text-navy\">Online Reputation Management</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted\">Strategic reputation and visibility support to help individuals and businesses present a credible, professional online presence.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-electric\">Explore <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--><!--/&--><!--/&--><!--/&--></main><footer class=\"border-t border-white/10 bg-navy text-white\"><div class=\"container-tight grid gap-10 py-14 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-9 w-9\"><rect width=\