cheme\",\"content\":\"light\"}]]\n10:T4,slug12:T4,slug2e:T11e2,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is a Wikipedia page creation service?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A Wikipedia page creation service helps eligible people, companies, and organizations assess Wikipedia notability, gather independent reliable sources, and prepare neutral, policy-aware draft or editing guidance. A responsible service does not control Wikipedia; independent volunteer editors review and decide on articles.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I create a Wikipedia page for my company or myself?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"To create a Wikipedia page, first confirm the subject meets Wikipedia notability guidelines through significant coverage in reliable, independent secondary sources. Then gather verifiable citations, draft a neutral article, follow conflict-of-interest and paid-contribution disclosure rules, and submit through the appropriate process (such as Articles for Creation). MIQ LLC can start with a notability and source assessment and provide policy-aware guidance.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can anyone get a Wikipedia page?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. A subject generally needs significant coverage in reliable, independent secondary sources to meet Wikipedia notability guidelines. Press releases, paid placements, company websites, social profiles, and routine announcements usually do not establish notability on their own.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much does Wikipedia page creation cost?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Wikipedia page creation and consulting costs vary based on the subject, available independent sources, research required, drafting complexity, and whether ongoing maintenance is needed. MIQ LLC provides a scope-based quote after reviewing your goals and existing reliable coverage; we do not charge for guaranteed approval because publication cannot be guaranteed.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does it take to create or publish a Wikipedia page?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Timelines depend on notability, source availability, research, drafting, and independent Wikipedia review. Research and draft preparation can take weeks, while review and publication times vary because volunteer editors control the process. MIQ LLC focuses on thorough, policy-compliant preparation rather than promising a fixed publication date.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you guarantee Wikipedia publication or page retention?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. MIQ LLC does not guarantee Wikipedia publication, approval, ranking, or retention. Wikipedia articles are reviewed and maintained by independent editors under community policies. Our role is ethical, research-driven consulting and policy-aware guidance.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What sources does Wikipedia consider reliable for notability?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Wikipedia generally looks for significant coverage in reliable, independent secondary sources such as reputable newspapers, magazines, books, academic publications, and editorially controlled media. The sources should be independent of the subject. Self-published content, press releases, and sponsored content are usually weak evidence of notability.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you follow Wikipedia paid-contribution and conflict-of-interest disclosure rules?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Our approach emphasizes transparency and alignment with Wikipedia paid-contribution disclosure and conflict-of-interest expectations. When compensated contributions are involved, disclosure and policy-compliant processes should be followed.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What Wikipedia services do you provide?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"MIQ LLC provides Wikipedia consulting, notability assessment, independent source and citation research, neutral article writing guidance, Wikipedia editing support, Articles for Creation (AfC) process guidance, conflict-of-interest guidance, and Wikipedia page maintenance or monitoring recommendations.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you provide worldwide Wikipedia consulting for international clients?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. MIQ LLC provides worldwide Wikipedia consulting for clients in the United States and internationally, supporting notability assessment, source research, neutral drafting guidance, editing support, and policy-aware recommendations through a digital-first process.\"}}]}24:[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/services/wikipedia-services#webpage\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Worldwide Wikipedia Services & Consulting\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Worldwide Wikipedia consulting, Wikipedia page creation guidance, Wikipedia editing services, notability assessment, citation research, and policy-aware page maintenance for companies, brands, executives, and organizations in the United States and internationally.\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/services/wikipedia-services\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#website\\\"},\\\"about\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\\\"},\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\"}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Service\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Worldwide Wikipedia Services & Consulting\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Worldwide Wikipedia consulting, Wikipe