text-white hover:bg-white/10\",\"children\":\"All Services\"}]]}]]}]}]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"section-pad border-b border-border bg-surface py-10 md:py-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container-tight \",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-3xl border border-electric/15 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm md:p-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric\",\"children\":\"Quick answer\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 max-w-4xl text-base leading-7 text-charcoal\",\"children\":\"A Wikipedia page creation service helps eligible subjects determine notability, gather independent reliable sources, and prepare neutral, policy-aware Wikipedia drafts or edits. To create a Wikipedia page, the subject usually needs significant coverage in independent secondary sources, a neutral point of view, verifiable citations, and compliance with Wikipedia conflict-of-interest and paid-contribution disclosure rules. No consultant can guarantee Wikipedia publication or retention because final decisions are made by independent Wikipedia editors.\"}]]}]}]}]\n32:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"$undefined\",\"className\":\"section-pad \",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container-tight grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-electric\",\"children\":\"Overview\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-navy md:text-4xl \",\"children\":\"Worldwide Wikipedia Services & Consulting\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-muted\",\"children\":\"Worldwide Wikipedia consulting, Wikipedia page creation guidance, Wikipedia editing services, notability assessment, citation research, and policy-aware page main