very & Goals\",\"text\":\"We review your background, objectives, existing public profile, and whether you need Wikipedia page creation, editing, notability research, or policy consultation.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Notability & Source Assessment\",\"text\":\"We evaluate independent reliable sources against Wikipedia notability standards, identify citation gaps, and determine whether the subject may be ready for a Wikipedia article or needs stronger third-party coverage.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Drafting, Citations & Policy Guidance\",\"text\":\"We organize verifiable sources and provide neutral, encyclopedic drafting or Wikipedia editing guidance with attention to reliable sourcing, neutrality, and conflict-of-interest considerations.\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Review, Disclosure & Maintenance\",\"text\":\"We recommend compliant next steps, including paid-contribution disclosure guidance, Articles for Creation considerations where relevant, and ongoing Wikipedia page maintenance or monitoring recommendations.\"}]}1d:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$26\"}}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"hero-grid text-white\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid-lines\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container-tight py-20 md:py-28\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"mb-4 text-sm text-white/65\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"hover:text-white\",\"children\":\"Home\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"/\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{\"href\":\"/services\",\"className\":\"hover:text-white\",\"children\":\"Services\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li